<title>BOTSWANA: BOTSWANA STOCKS WEEK - No trades during Xmas week.</title>
<headline>BOTSWANA STOCKS WEEK - No trades during Xmas week.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were no trades on the Botswana Stock Exchange (BSE) during the three days the exchange was open last week.</p>
<p>Kgola ya Sechaba (KYS) was bid up 25 thebe on overseas demand following the liquidation announcment, but no sellers emerged.</p>
<p>The index rose 2.22 points to close at 351.71 points.</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
